#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/cart.rst:99
msgid ""
"Customers have the possibility to **re-order** items from **previous sales "
"orders** on the customer portal. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings --> Shop - Checkout Process` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Re-order From Portal`. Customers can find "
"the :guilabel:`Order Again` button on their **sales order** from the "
