msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:34
msgid "Address: B2B fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:36
msgid ""
"Optional :guilabel:`TIN/VAT` and :guilabel:`Company Name` fields can be "
"added to the :guilabel:`Billing Address` form for B2B customers, at "
"the :guilabel:`Address` step. To add the fields, go to :menuselection:`Edit "
