msgid "Product images and videos"
msgstr "صور ومقاطع فيديو المنتجات"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products.rst:224
msgid ""
"To add more media items, such as images and videos, navigate to "
"the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>`, then go to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab and click :guilabel:`Add a media` under "
"the :guilabel:`Extra Product Media` section. In the :guilabel:`Create Extra "
