"الإضافية (بما في ذلك عبر رابط) أو :guilabel:`احذف الكل`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"Images must be in PNG or JPG format and with a minimum size of 1024x1024 to "
"trigger the zoom."
