msgid ""
":guilabel:`Website`: From this section, you can :guilabel:`Switch "
"Theme`, :doc:`Add a Language <../configuration/translate>`, select "
"the :guilabel:`Page Layout`, and customize the :guilabel:`Background` by "
"uploading your own image."
msgstr ""

